{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"catalogs/runtime/scenes/425d1b8dadae4880f052.json":{"assets":{"ep3/quest_story_13225440":{"skip":{"source_cn":"你们驱赶了活死人，获救的冬青学员告知自己还有一个同伴往湖中的岛屿方向跑了。","text_i18n":{"cn":"你们驱赶了活死人，获救的冬青学员告知自己还有一个同伴往湖中的岛屿方向跑了。","en":"After repelling the undead, the rescued scholar tells you about a companion who has escaped to the island in the lake.","jp":"あなたたちは生きた屍を退治すると、救助したソヨゴの学者から同僚が湖心の島に向かったと告げられた。","kr":"살아있는 시체를 쫓아냈다. 구출한 상록수 학회 학자는 다른 동료가 호수의 섬 쪽으로 도망갔다고 알려주었다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["13225440"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["24290"]}}}},"catalogs/runtime/scenes/8aa28c0800ecd5fe2d1c.json":{"assets":{"ep3/quest_story_13225410":{"skip":{"source_cn":"侍卫长告知有两个疯狂的冬青学员闯入了哀叹之湖的遗迹，情况紧急，委托你前往营救。","text_i18n":{"cn":"侍卫长告知有两个疯狂的冬青学员闯入了哀叹之湖的遗迹，情况紧急，委托你前往营救。","en":"Captain Rodrigo entrusts you with rescuing the two reckless scholars who have wandered into the ruins of Sorrowfall Lake.","jp":"二人のソヨゴの学者が、無謀にも嘆きの湖の遺跡に立ち入ったとのことで、護衛隊長はあなたに緊急救助を依頼した。","kr":"근위대장은 정신 나간 상록수 학회 학자 두 명이 탄식의 호수 유적으로 들어갔다고 말하며, 상황이 시급하니 어서 학자들을 구해달라고 의뢰했다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["13225410"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["24289"]}}}},"catalogs/runtime/scenes/a05ee49fc58ea53e0cef.json":{"assets":{"ep3/quest_story_13225450":{"skip":{"source_cn":"你们及时营救了另一位冬青学员，虽然她没受到实质伤害，但已经被吓得语无伦次了。","text_i18n":{"cn":"你们及时营救了另一位冬青学员，虽然她没受到实质伤害，但已经被吓得语无伦次了。","en":"You have rescued another lost scholar! Although she isn't physically injured, she is too frightened to speak clearly.","jp":"間一髪のところで、あなたたちはソヨゴの学者を救出した。彼女に怪我はなかったが、とても怯えていて、うまく話すことができないようだ。","kr":"또 다른 상록수 학회 학자를 구헸다. 학자는 크게 다치지 않았지만 겁에 질려 말을 하지 못하는 상태였다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["13225450"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["24291"]}}}},"catalogs/runtime/scenes/c27ad14128442e104ef0.json":{"assets":{"ep3/quest_story_13225460":{"skip":{"source_cn":"冬青学员对你们表示了感谢，侍卫长表示很快会联络学会接走他们。","text_i18n":{"cn":"冬青学员对你们表示了感谢，侍卫长表示很快会联络学会接走他们。","en":"While the scholars express their gratitude, Captain Rodrigo says he will have the Evergreen Conservatory pick them up shortly.","jp":"ソヨゴの学者たちは感謝を示し、護衛隊長は学会に連絡して、すぐに迎えをよこすと言った。","kr":"상록수 학회 학자는 우리에게 감사를 표했고, 근위대장은 곧 학회와 연락해 그들을 데려가게 하겠다고 말했다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["13225460"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["24292"]}}}},"faction_dailies/graphs/13010536/1.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010536:1:1","roots":["end"],"nodes":{"end":{"id":"end","type":"end"}},"text_entries":{},"speaker_entries":{},"stats":{"node_count":1,"text_entry_count":0},"source":"ExplStep objective boundary, not invented dialogue."},"faction_dailies/graphs/13010536/2.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010536:1:2","roots":["end"],"nodes":{"end":{"id":"end","type":"end"}},"text_entries":{},"speaker_entries":{},"stats":{"node_count":1,"text_entry_count":0},"source":"ExplStep objective boundary, not invented dialogue."},"faction_dailies/graphs/13010536/3.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010536:1:3","roots":["end"],"nodes":{"end":{"id":"end","type":"end"}},"text_entries":{},"speaker_entries":{},"stats":{"node_count":1,"text_entry_count":0},"source":"ExplStep objective boundary, not invented dialogue."},"faction_dailies/graphs/13010536/4.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010536:1:4","roots":["end"],"nodes":{"end":{"id":"end","type":"end"}},"text_entries":{},"speaker_entries":{},"stats":{"node_count":1,"text_entry_count":0},"source":"ExplStep objective boundary, not invented dialogue."},"faction_dailies/graphs/13010536/5.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010536:1:5","roots":["end"],"nodes":{"end":{"id":"end","type":"end"}},"text_entries":{},"speaker_entries":{},"stats":{"node_count":1,"text_entry_count":0},"source":"ExplStep objective boundary, not invented dialogue."},"faction_dailies/graphs/13010536/6.json":{"schema_version":1,"asse